      "value": "I had a difficulty trying to find home, sit/stand because of the words are small to notice it’s there. \n\nThe 2 options below 3 options are going to be very useless because I don’t want to shop, including the events that are live. \n\nThe new quick menu look does look very useless, with the full menu I prefer the old one. Why I wanna go to live or upcoming events that I’m not interested?",
