      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "+1 .. Gave it a chance, but the most used buttons like \"respawn\" and \"calibrate\" is just .. a lot more inconvenient now.. Like.. why?\n\nNot to mention the content of the big menu (Live now) section being utterly irrelevant to how I use vrc. I could not care less. And even having it automatically pop up on every start is just infuriating. \n\nI gave it a go. Tried not to judge it. But nothing of these changes have been an improvement - Quite the opposite.",
